    "body": "So I use Powerlevel9k and installed starship and ran the setup line `eval \"$(starship init zsh)\"\r\n` directly inside my terminal and it both loaded starship, and maintained my powerlevel9k RPROMPT. \r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/7043587/65102701-3d573200-da0f-11e9-9912-584b8d4f4255.png)\r\n\r\nI'm guessing it means starship isn't interfering with the PL9K right prompt which is a good sign that it would be possible to set one up. ",
