    "created_at": "2020-05-04T16:31:50Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-05-04T16:31:50Z",
    "body": "Ideally, we would support right-prompts for both shells that internally support a right-prompt (zsh, fish) and those that don't (bash). For the former, we'll use `$RPROMPT`, while the latter would be spaced out using `$COLUMNS`.\r\n\r\nInstead of having an `rprompt` module, it would make most sense to me to provide a `prompt_order_right` root property to match the existing `prompt_order` property.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
